      "side": 1,
      "message": "I like using the stage names, but the general trend has gone the opposite way since there often times multiple builds for a given stage (proto0, proto1, evt0, evt1, etc). Nowadays we churn out boards with incrementally higher board IDs and decide on the name later. Trying to designate names beforehand has always been painful since changes needed to accommodate extra builds requires changes across multiple codebases (EC, coreboot, depthcharge, kernel, mosys, gooftool, maybe others).",
